WEBVTT

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:07.810
And after passing the age of 30 will have nothing
to do but kill time with their fingers and cucumbers...

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:14.990
Let's go right now. If I don't beat the hell outta
that damn woman today, I'll shut this inn down.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:31.530
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:53.020
Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage

00:00:53.960 --> 00:01:01.660
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:08.360
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:11.880
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:19.040
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.750
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:29.100
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:35.040
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:39.370
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.410
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:46.590
whose name we've yet to know

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.340
Show yourself, Obu!

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:05.520
Who is it, interrupting my afternoon nap?

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.230
Come out already, Obu!

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:12.190
Hi Rei-chan! Long time no see, what's up?

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.820
Don't give me that! You should
know very well why I'm here!

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:19.240
This has been my greatest fear.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.950
I've done so many things, it could be anything...

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:27.750
Rei-chan, are you PMSing?

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:31.600
You called me an uneducated
and uncouth man-hulk like psycho,

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:37.290
who stands no chance with a man or les partner. That I'll spend my days with my fingers,

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.260
cucumbers, and a big butter dog.
And told Oriku that I'm a con man!

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.550
Huh? Con man?

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:46.130
So you're the master.

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:50.520
Fine. Let's have a go. It's about time
we hit a rift in our relationship.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.020
Will you marry me, if I win?

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:12.680
This force, it's making my heart beat.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:15.980
It's as if every meridian in my body is pulsing.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:20.300
And it's just her Ki. Goes to show
how powerful the Jindan stage really is.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.550
Rei-san hasn't even budged.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.760
She's as immovable as a mountain.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.490
Got my divine sword back!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:51.870
Isn't that just a bamboo stick, you cheapskate.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.880
It's my loss, you can do whatever
you want to me, Rei-chan.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.430
No, not me.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:02.050
The one who can do as he pleases,
is your lovely disciple, Oriku.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:06.800
For real? You're right! Now that
I think about it, you set me up!

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:12.290
Actually I was drunk. But a bet is a bet.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:16.280
What should I do? Should I really
let him do as he pleases?

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.580
No no, he's only 14.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:25.280
He won't be able to hold out. He probably
has no technique, I'm sure it'll be no fun for me.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:30.690
Hey, you were thinking dirty thoughts just
now weren't you!? Forget all that for now.

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:33.330
Yeah of you're right, we don't
need to be in such a hurry!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.800
I just want one thing from you right now.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:41.560
Please, be serious and teach me
some real cultivation techniques.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:45.260
Riku-chan, you think I haven't
been teaching you in earnest?

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:49.520
You don't know anything do you?

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:53.370
You think I'm just keeping you around as a pet?

00:04:53.370 --> 00:05:01.280
The Chief promised me tons of money
and handsome men, if I train you well.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:06.950
Money might be possible, but how can
that old geezer get you handsome men?

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:13.960
Hey, tell me what you've been planning all along.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:19.130
First, I need to think about how that old geezer
is going get me some good-looking men.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.130
I should've chose the other option.

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:28.640
Do you even know how much I've spent on
your medicinal baths, these past two years?

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.640
It definitely didn't cost as much as your alcohol.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:35.890
B-But it all paid off. Isn't that right, Rei-chan?

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.020
She's right.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:45.740
Two years ago were just average, albeit with
good potential, but you were still fairly weak.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:51.410
However, you were able to pick up the technique
I taught you yesterday, quicker than expected.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.910
I think to some degree, this bath has
improved your physical capabilities.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:06:01.250
Really? I know learning martial
arts and cultivation are different,

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:04.140
but no other disciples are doing this.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:07.680
They prioritize cultivation over body building.

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:13.180
There must be a reason as to why your
teacher chose to strengthen your body first.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:17.350
That's right Rei-chan, you know me so well!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:22.240
I made you take this bath for two years,

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:25.280
so that I could prepare you for
my Amorphic Bones technique.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:30.390
The Amorphic Bones Technique
is for cultivators at the Jindan stage.

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:34.160
Your Void Spirit Base has
a close affinity to the divine Ki,

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:42.470
so the divine Ki can freely enter your body.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:53.950
This may sound great at first, but this also means
that the Ki gathered in your body freely leaves as well.

00:06:53.950 --> 00:07:00.920
That is to say, it goes in one way and comes right
out the other, without leaving a single drop.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:07.820
In short, you don't have enough strength to
preserve the Ki which passes through your body.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:13.420
My Amorphic Bones Technique is too complex to accurately explain,

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:20.250
but it would be analogous to a plug in a funnel.

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:28.010
It will make it possible for you to gather
Ki so you can finally start cultivation.

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:31.850
Even though it goes against the very
nature of your Void Spirit Base,

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:34.760
at least you can cultivate like others.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.090
It's better than just being specimen
because of your Spirit Base right?

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:45.990
I'm not some omnipotent god, I can only
make progress through trial and error.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:52.660
It all makes sense now, so how long 'till
I can actually start learning Amorphic Bones?

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:58.290
Um, I guess about another 34567890 baths.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:02.080
What's with that obviously made up
number and dubious expression?

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:06.090
The effects of this medicinal bath
decrease the more you use it,

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.330
so you need to replenish the
ingredients every now and then.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:12.580
I'm aware of that, but that's not really feasible.

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:15.940
I spent my entire fortune
on the ingredients for this bath.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.850
I have no funds for replenishment.

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:22.080
Isn't this the meridian reconstructing
and marrow refreshing water?

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.510
Sure, it's hard to find in the normal world,

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:29.280
but you should be able to find the materials
with no problem on Reiken Mountain.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:33.320
It may be a bit expensive, but you should be able
to afford it with Oriku's subsidy funds alone.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:37.120
Rei-chan, you betrayed me for a man!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.790
Just shut up and replenish the bath!

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.970
My cultivation has been going well.

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:49.430
In order to reach the next stage, I was told
to take a break to rest both my body and mind.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:57.010
O-san, I'll be heading out on a retreat soon.

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:01.680
If everything works out, would it be
possible to meet up near Reikei Village?

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:12.570
This super medicinal bath is totally different.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:16.490
It's as if my whole body is being
revitalized. Feels so good.

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:23.250
At least half of a years' worth of booze money must've went into that bath.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:30.510
Must've been nice. It's like you're a new person.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.100
How can you tell?

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:37.860
It's hard to tell from just the outside,
but you have great potential to begin with.

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:42.010
After this bath, it should be easier to tap into it.
I'm really looking forward to your cultivation.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:46.230
I expected no less from the super medicinal bath.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:53.900
What? It wouldn't of worked if you
hadn't used it for two years straight!

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.780
So we can work on Amorphic Bones now, right?

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:13.410
Come to think of it, I never did get a chance to show
my techniques to you these past two years, did I?

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:20.230
Of course, you were too busy sleeping and drinking.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.080
You're a funny one aren't you?

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:29.310
In any case, I myself developed
the Amorphic Bones technique.

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:35.350
In the world of cultivation, there's a widely held belief
that the older a technique is, the more powerful it is.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:39.680
That's why self created techniques
like mine are so looked down upon.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:44.290
But that's a misunderstanding.
Cultivation is unique to each individual.

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:49.250
Old techniques created by others
will never be your own.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:53.290
Only what you create and experience
for yourself can become your own.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:58.390
So in other words, it's better to masturbate
than take another person's spouse?

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:02.010
That's a rather crude metaphor, but not bad.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:10.020
The Amorphic Techniques really do suits me
best after all these years of improvement.

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:14.290
Which includes the Amorphic Bones,
Amorphic Swords, and Amorphic Sets.

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:19.530
Altogether, they're a complete set of techniques
not inferior to the Stellar Techniques.

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:27.730
Stellar Techniques is a legacy of techniques passed down
from chief to chief every generation, for thousands of years.

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:30.290
It's vast and deep, but it hasn't changed.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:35.670
It also only suits a few cultivators,
with specific kinds of potential.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:40.970
However, my Amorphic Techniques change with time.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:43.880
Really? Is that possible?

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:47.020
It's already currently at the 98th version.

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:49.850
Its strength is in the flexibility of its framework.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:54.210
With a solid foundation you can
change it almost any way you like.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:56.990
Update it with new ideas and such.

00:11:56.990 --> 00:12:00.240
On average, there's one big update per year.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:04.330
Changed every year? That's so arbitrary.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:10.360
It can be molded to fit many different situations.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:13.350
In all the Nine Regions,

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:18.750
my Amorphic technique is the only one
that will work with your Void Spirit Base.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.170
Your progress in cultivation will
be a matter of trial and error.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:26.430
Your main source of direction and momentum
will be through this Amorphic technique.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:32.850
I think I finally understand why
the Reiken Sect chose her as my mentor.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:37.110
I'll start teaching you the technique tomorrow.

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:47.370
Not bad, considering the fact that
this is your third day of training.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:54.540
If you could perform Inner Observance,
you'd be surprised by the changes.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:13:01.860
What's with this technique? It's like the Dragon
Subduing Palms where I only did 10 sets,

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:04.690
but my entire body is throbbing in pain.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.970
Did I learn the technique properly?

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:14.480
Of course not, you're just getting started.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:19.730
But I have to say, I thought it
would take at least half a month.

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:25.950
The Void Spirit Base really
is impressive, you learned so fast.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:29.320
Everything hurts.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:36.830
Once that pain subsides, you'll really be able to start
learning the technique, and will be able to apply it.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:40.610
Is this embarrassing pose also part of the lesson?

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:43.390
It's because you'd grope my breasts if I carried you.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.590
As if!

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:52.610
Prioritizing body technique instead
of Ki gathering isn't the norm.

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:55.350
It's pretty unheard of in the world of cultivation,

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:59.720
because there still isn't enough Ki to protect the body.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:04.610
When your body starts to evolve,
you wouldn't be able to bear the pain.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:09.710
But with the help of the meridian reconstructing
and marrow refreshing water, from these past two years,

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:14.120
your body should now be able to endure it.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:19.120
Frankly speaking, I'm surprised you're
not already dead! I was kinda worried.

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:25.880
Can I start cultivation now that I'm
at the first stage of Amorphic Bones?

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:33.720
Based on the size of your funnel, It won't be before
the 9th or 10th stage that you can stop the leak.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:38.980
9th or 10th? How many stages
are there to the Amorphic Bones?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:42.610
Currently, there are 120 in total. I'm at stage 103.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:49.700
With the technique being constantly updated,
there's really no limit to how far it can go.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.830
That's so arbitrary...

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:58.910
Since it took me three days to complete the first stage,
I should be able reach the tenth in a month.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.580
Then I can finally say goodbye to this pain.

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.090
Guess you'll be bedridden for some time.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:09.260
I personally made some food for you.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.340
You must be so grateful!

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:25.150
Oriku returned to his routine going to and from
between Ethereal Peak and Amorphic Peak,

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:29.900
taking lessons in the Cloud Crossing Halls during the day,

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:36.150
and training the Amorphic Bones at night.

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:38.660
One month passed in the blink of an eye.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:45.350
I've finally reached the 3rd stage of Amorphic Bones.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:48.860
It's been slower than expected,
but according to my teacher,

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.430
it's fast enough.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.600
There's only one problem...

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.770
So if everything is progressing well,
what do you need from me?

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:04.810
It feels like the pain has stopped
now that I've past the first stage.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:08.030
But according to my teacher,
it's not that the pain has stopped,

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:11.780
it's that my body has a higher pain tolerance.

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:17.530
At the rate I'm going, I wouldn't even feel it
if someone cut off my dick while I was asleep.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:22.920
Right now, I think the main problem is that

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:28.550
the Amorphic Bones hasn't
yet benefited me in any way.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:33.710
I didn't get the strength of
a bear or the speed of a cougar,

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:37.430
in fact, my running speed has dropped.

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:41.810
I also lost that sense of the Ki
coursing through my muscles,

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.640
from when I learned the Dragon Subduing Palms.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.900
That's strange.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.750
You built the meridians so there's no way...

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:56.320
Oh I know it must have been "overwritten"
by the higher-level technique.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:00.620
For example if you mastered
the Snow Thawing of the Six Yang,

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:07.580
If you now learned the Nine Yang,
the former would be overwritten.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:13.860
Amorphic Bones is a technique in cultivation,
at a higher level than martial arts.

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.030
So therefore, it must be overwritten.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:20.820
What's the deal with this technique?
Not only has it so far proven to be useless,

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:24.010
it's overwritten my martial arts.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:29.150
Well, I know the Amorphic Bones is really strong,

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:33.360
so it's no big deal to lose one martial
arts technique in the process.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.920
You say that but...

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.780
You said you'd be my teacher, didn't you?

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:41.370
Eh, I did?

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:47.040
You must know some techniques
that wouldn't get overwritten.

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:52.530
You've already started your cultivation,
you shouldn't bother with this.

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:58.550
You're the only martial arts master
I can count on. So would you please?

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:03.810
Well it is kind of fun teaching someone like you...

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:06.230
All right, let's give it a go.

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:11.040
During the Celestial Gathering the guides
were riding on swords right?

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.980
That's called "sword control",

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:19.080
it's a kind of technique that makes you lighter,
making it easier to run and fly.

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:22.120
Obu doesn't have much interest
in that kind of technique.

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:26.840
That's why there aren't any skills like that
included in the Amorphic set of techniques.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:31.630
I'm gonna teach you a set
of Qingong for the average person.

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:37.270
You won't be able to use sword
control until the Foundation Stage,

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:42.640
so what I'm about to teach you will be useful.

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:46.660
It's called the Entangling Steps.

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:51.540
You'll be able to use it to run and climb with ease,

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:56.150
and overcome your opponent
in a fight through agility.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:06.540
Entangling Steps is a rather complicated technique
that requires a great deal of balance and flexibility.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:09.940
However, Oriku, with his bright mind
and two years worth of training,

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:13.670
managed to get the hang of it fairly quickly.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:19.620
Great work, you pretty much
nailed the basics on the first day.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.300
All you've gotta do now is practice.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:26.890
I'll bring you some divine grass again, as thanks.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.200
It should sell for a pretty penny.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:34.820
If only I still had the money from
our radish sales two years ago.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:38.490
<i>Have you already spent it all?</i>

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:45.300
Right now, the only thing keeping the inn from going
under is the money I get from selling the divine grass.

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.990
But whatever, it's just money.

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:51.750
Anyway, practice hard.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.790
I'll treat you to stewed pork feet
if you manage to master it.

00:19:56.770 --> 00:20:00.820
Oh right, before I go, I want to introduce
you to a new training partner.

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:16.060
As always, thank you.

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:20.290
Three months of studying, bodybuilding, martial arts,

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:23.570
and triathlon-like training passed in a flash.

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:28.580
What's with this lovey dovey aura.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:35.950
Yes!

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:39.130
You did it! You're so skilled, Aya-neesama.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.420
Bunho, you're no joke.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.800
It's your turn next, Bun-chan.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.430
I'll try my best.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:47.930
Bun-chan...

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:49.970
Fatty!

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:56.190
Wow, amazing!

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:03.820
Welcome, your 10 Stargazey Pies are ready,
I'll bring them out to you.

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:07.890
10? Who ordered that?

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:10.730
A big fan of the food here.

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:13.250
Nah, more like a fan of the cook.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.750
A rival has shown up!?

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:27.340
All right now that you've filled your belly, let's start.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.250
Ready, set, go!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:41.070
Whoops my bad!

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:51.150
Why does she look so serious.

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:53.660
What happened today?

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.120
What? Essence of the Jindan?

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:59.520
Wait, can she actually read?

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:02.130
And on top of that, it's not some erotica, but a classic on cultivation?

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:04.200
Is this for real?

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:23.820
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:27.290
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.460 --> 00:22:29.130
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:35.150
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:40.550
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.890 --> 00:22:51.400
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:57.840
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:01.570
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.850 --> 00:23:04.770
oh so powerfully

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:10.330
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:15.920
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:26.020
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:37.500
"The Trial at Azure".

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:39.340
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
